Reused from the upstream project, with modifications:

  - src/atlas/**      renderer components, atlas data (zh/en), lessons, quizzes,
                      i18n dictionaries, stylesheet, 3D builders, CIF-driven
                      custom structures
  - src/electron/**   CIF lexer/parser/space-group expansion/structure extraction,
                      settings and notes schema

Modifications: the stylesheet is scoped to `.sw-atlas`; the 3D stage is driven by
plain three.js instead of @react-three/fiber, @react-three/drei and n8ao; the
Vite-only builder registry is replaced by a generated static map; the Electron
preload bridge is replaced by a page-side implementation; drag-and-drop and
keyboard handling are scoped to the panel; a CIF file picker and a download-based
notes export replace the native menu and save dialog.

Original to this package
------------------------

  - index.js, client.js (build output), cordis.patch.yml, package.json
  - src/client/**     slot registration, theme and locale inheritance, the page
                      bridge, the panel shell styles
  - scripts/build.mjs build pipeline
  - icon.svg          original artwork
